n        {\n          \"id\": \"fact_92f951b99fe6091e9310ecb2\",\n          \"stance\": \"support\",\n          \"value\": \"The user has a strong and enduring interest in community involvement, particularly through literature and reading-related activities. They have organized a book swap (though found it overwhelming), participated in a reading marathon for charity (positive experience), conducted an interview with a well-known author leading to a community event (positive experience), started regular volunteering at a local library (positive experience), curated a list of must-read books for a community newsletter (positive experience), helped organize book recommendations for library patrons (positive experience), joined a local book club focused on contemporary fiction (positive experience), attended a national literature festival (positive experience), and formed a partnership with local artists to create book-themed merchandise for events (positive experience). They also joined a community buying group but found it less engaging. Their values include fostering literacy, community connection, and shared experiences around books.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s78\", \"s40\", \"s105\", \"s121\", \"s104\", \"s21\", \"s13\", \"s5\", \"s79\", \"s20\", \"s39\", \"s32\", \"s58\", \"s113\", \"s95\", \"s77\", \"s12\", \"s47\", \"s22\", \"s48\", \"s30\", \"s57\", \"s31\", \"s120\", \"s4\", \"s3\", \"s112\", \"s49\", \"s96\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"lifetime\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user describes multiple community activities across various conversations: organizing a book swap (s3-s5), a reading marathon for charity (s30-s32), an author interview event (s12-s13), library volunteering (s39-s40), curating a book list for a newsletter (s57-s58), helping organize book recommendations at a library (s77-s79), joining a book club (s95-s96), attending a literature festival (s120-s121), and partnering with artists for book-themed merchandise (s104-s105). The buying group was disappointing (s20-s22, s47-s49). The positive experiences center on literature and community, supporting a general interest in community involvement through literary and reading-related activities.\",\n          \"summary_revision\": {\n            \"supersedes_route_ids\": [\"fact_e6ff3737a45feca785fd5199\"],\n            \"previous_version\": 1,\n            \"reason\": \"Incorporating additional compatible evidence from new source spans (s57-s58, s77-s79, s95-s96, s104-s105, s112-s113, s120-s121) that further support the user's interest in community involvement through literature, while retaining all original evidence and the negative experience with the buying group.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"variable\": \"constraints\",\n      \"observations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fact_571811c40e127b98665800fb\",\n          \"stance\": \"support\",\n          \"value\": \"The user faced significant stress and overwhelm while planning a community book swap, due to the complexities of coordinating genres, managing schedules, ensuring enough participants, and devising a fair distribution system. This led to disheartenment about pursuing similar events. Additionally, the user found a community buying group less engaging than expected, with stagnant conversations and a lack of clear focus or direction, leading to disappointment. These challenges could affect continuing community event planning.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s21\", \"s5\", \"s20\", \"s47\", \"s22\", \"s48\", \"s4\", \"s3\", \"s49\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"recent\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user explicitly describes feeling overwhelmed and stressed by the logistics of the book swap (s3-s5), and disheartened